{"ID":"20240118151343-8sw0sjw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151343-8sw0sjw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151343-8sw0sjw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151343-i7smc7j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119173253-j2mm0bd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119173253-j2mm0bd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"050灵芝赤芝黑芝青芝白芝黄芝紫芝","type":"doc","updated":"20240126171834"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151343-i7smc7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151343-i7smc7j","updated":"20240119173206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤芝—味苦平，主胸中结，益心气，补中，增慧智，不忘，久服轻身不老，延年神仙。一名丹芝。生霍山。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173213-ndc7ibs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173213-ndc7ibs","updated":"20240119173222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黑芝—味咸平，主癃，利水道，益肾气，通九窍，聪察，久服轻身不老，延年神仙。一名元芝。生恒山。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173218-6rntdml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173218-6rntdml","updated":"20240119173222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"青芝—味酸平，主明目补肝气，安精魂，仁恕，久服轻身不老，延年神仙。一名龙芝。生太白。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173219-z1xojqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173219-z1xojqg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芝—味辛平，主咳逆上气，益肺气，通利口鼻，强志意，勇悍，安魂，久服轻身不老，延年神仙。一名玉芝。生华山。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173226-d0dlgnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173226-d0dlgnh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芝—味甘平，主心腹五邪，益脾气，安神，忠信和乐，久服轻身不老，延年神仙。一名金芝。生嵩山。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173230-vls67u4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173230-vls67u4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"紫芝—味甘温，主耳聋，利关节，保神，益精气，坚筋骨，好颜色，久服轻身不老，延年神仙。一名木芝。生高夏地上，色紫形如桑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173238-wh89hoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173238-wh89hoc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六芝皆无毒，六月八月采。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173243-je1q1no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173243-je1q1no"}},{"ID":"20240119173243-v93cw82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173243-v93cw82"}},{"ID":"20240119173243-jrv0xu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173243-jrv0xu4","updated":"20240119173244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第50，我们过去吃灵芝，灵芝呢我们有青赤黄白黑，再加上个紫色的，紫芝，一共是六种灵芝。那芝类的东西也是滋补的东西，能够益气补心啊，补心肾啊，肝心脾肺肾都有。"}]},{"ID":"20240119173248-e9lojtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173248-e9lojtf","updated":"20240126171816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以它的芝分青赤黄白黑，青芝补肝嘛，红芝补心嘛，白芝补肺嘛，黄芝补脾嘛，黑芝补这个肾，那紫芝嘛，你就看一下“坚筋骨，好颜色”，吃了以后气色会非常好。女孩子久服轻身不老，女孩子最喜欢了。要年轻要白，不要黑。这是紫芝。那这些药通通是无毒性的，都可以吃，你可以把它磨粉吃。至于说，你看我们过去药典写的很好玩，你看，赤芝呢，你看中间，志不忘，记忆力会很强，那黑芝呢能够聪察，那你去当检察官检查脑筋很聪明。那青芝呢“仁恕”吃的人很仁恕。所以如果是你的岳父脾气不好，你就赶快送点青芝给他吃。诸如此类的，有没有效就看个人啦。对身体很好是肯定的。"}]},{"ID":"20240119173253-j2mm0bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173253-j2mm0bd","updated":"20240126171834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那至于现代的药理学说它可以治疗癌症啊什么的，我是姑且听之，因为这些芝类的东西它的药性都是很平和的，没有办法把阴实打开来的药，在中医理论上能够治病很难，但是能够袪命延年，就是预防生病，能够让你的五脏六腑功能变得很强，我承认它有这个功能，真的治病差一段。"}]}]}